<p><strong>SCP-3150:</strong> The Caravanserai at the End of the World<br />
<strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tufto" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3337265); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3337265&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608771561" alt="Tufto" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3337265)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tufto" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3337265); return false;">Tufto</a></span>, written on their original account. More of their work can be found <a href="/tufto-personnel-file">here</a>.<br />
<strong>Image:</strong> Can be found <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Caravanserai-i-Shah_,_Qazvin_by_Eug%C3%A8ne_Flandin.jpg">here</a>, and is in the public domain.</p>
